## [2.3.1] — Hero CTA removed, offer medallion emphasised

- **The hero "Call to order" button is gone.** It had been removed once already
  at the user's request and then reintroduced by mistake during the 2.3.0 hero
  rebuild, copied across from the kineticfiber reference. The hero's only
  action is now the ZIP checker; the header carries the call path.
- **The medallion carries the emphasis on its own**, since it is the only thing
  left in that column:
  - a breathing glow behind it (opacity + scale, 6s)
  - two counter-rotating dotted orbits — fine red dots inside, wider glacier
    blue dashes outside (34s and 52s, opposite directions)
  - an inner hairline so the seal has an edge rather than a flat fill
  - larger: `clamp(16rem, 28vw, 21rem)`
  - lifts slightly on hover
- The medallion is now a link to the offers rail with a "See all offers"
  affordance inside it, so it does something without becoming a second call
  button.

All medallion animation is transform and opacity only, so it stays on the
compositor, and the reduced-motion block stops every piece of it.

